cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "INQUIRE_CSI – Contaminant Source Identification Pipeline"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license: "MIT License"
repository-code: "https://github.com/r3bryk/INQUIRE_CSI"
abstract: "Python/JupyterLab pipeline that attributes organic compounds detected in environmental samples (e.g., household dust) 
  by non-target screening to their most plausible source categories, using a master contaminant source database and 
  a weighted set-cover optimization with priors."
keywords:
  - non-target screening
  - contaminant source identification
  - household dust
  - set cover
  - exposome
authors:
